{"id":"0f061d99a59e6f71","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-lem-soundness.md","title":"Soundness","display":"lem-soundness — Soundness","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-soundness","aliases":["58-lem-soundness"],"display":"lem-soundness — Soundness","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-proof.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-logic.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-model6-sentence-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-soundness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-soundness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-soundness — Soundness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"68fd6aebcf2cd4ac\" href=\"?note=68fd6aebcf2cd4ac\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-proof.md\">../batch04/58-df-proof.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"44e32f3fb4334e0c\" href=\"?note=44e32f3fb4334e0c\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-logic.md\">../batch17/58-df-logic.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b00c32fa4e76ff85\" href=\"?note=b00c32fa4e76ff85\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-model6-sentence-set.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-model6-sentence-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L,S_0,\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{FOL}}\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal L,S_0,\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{FOL}}\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel6SentenceSet}_S(\\mathcal L,S_0)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel6SentenceSet}_S(\\mathcal L,S_0)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b00c32fa4e76ff85\" href=\"?note=b00c32fa4e76ff85\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-model6-sentence-set.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-model6-sentence-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq S_0\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq S_0\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in S_0\">\\(\\varphi\\in S_0\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\">\\(\\Gamma\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\)</span> is semantic consequence and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{FOL}}}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\pi\\;\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{FOL}}}(\\pi,\\Gamma,\\varphi)\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{FOL}}}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\pi\\;\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{FOL}}}(\\pi,\\Gamma,\\varphi)\\)</span> as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"44e32f3fb4334e0c\" href=\"?note=44e32f3fb4334e0c\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-logic.md\">../batch17/58-df-logic.md</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{FOL}}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{FOL}}\\)</span> is the fixed standard first-order proof calculus used by this theorem</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}soundness} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel6SentenceSet}_S(\\mathcal L,S_0)\\land\\Gamma\\subseteq S_0\\land\\varphi\\in S_0\\land\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{FOL}}}\\varphi\\to\\Gamma\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}soundness} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel6SentenceSet}_S(\\mathcal L,S_0)\\land\\Gamma\\subseteq S_0\\land\\varphi\\in S_0\\land\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{FOL}}}\\varphi\\to\\Gamma\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Everything provable is semantically valid.</li>\n<li>Soundness connects the explicitly fixed proof calculus with the canonical semantics; it is not asserted for an arbitrary relation called <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-proof.md","status":"resolved","id":"68fd6aebcf2cd4ac","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-proof.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-logic.md","status":"resolved","id":"44e32f3fb4334e0c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-logic.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-model6-sentence-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"b00c32fa4e76ff85","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-model6-sentence-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-model6-sentence-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"b00c32fa4e76ff85","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal L,S_0,\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{FOL}}\\in V$ and $\\mathrm{ZfcModel6SentenceSet}_S(\\mathcal L,S_0)$ (see [[../batch18/58-df-zfc-model6-sentence-set.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-logic.md","status":"resolved","id":"44e32f3fb4334e0c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Gamma\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi$ is semantic consequence and $\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{FOL}}}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\pi\\;\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{FOL}}}(\\pi,\\Gamma,\\varphi)$ as in [[../batch17/58-df-logic.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L,S_0,\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{FOL}}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel6SentenceSet}_S(\\mathcal L,S_0)","display":fal